WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:10.800
Our Rural Area &amp; Small Settlements
Ō Tātou Hapori Taiwhenua me nga Nohoanga

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:17.220
Rural areas currently make up the majority
of the District, and agriculture and the rural

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:22.600
economy play a major part in the District’s
wealth creation, employment and character.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:28.420
The Waimakariri District has one of the largest
lifestyle-block populations

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.960
of any district in the country.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:36.780
We need to be mindful that further lifestyle
development may impact on large-scale productive

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:40.020
land use and the character of the rural area.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:47.760
The District also features small rural towns
and settlements.

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:53.100
These are diverse in both location and character
and we need to think carefully about what

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:56.360
we want them to look like in the future.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:03.200
Our District Our Future, Waimakariri 2048
aims to:

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:25.740
So what do you think?

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:30.880
Let us know your thoughts and find out more
about the District Development Strategy at

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:34.540
waimakariri.govt.nz

